# Configuration precedence

Resolution order (highest to lowest): CLI override → environment variable → `config/strategies/<name>.toml` → strategy class default.

- Non-strategy infra (DB URL, log level, host ports): environment-only is fine.
- Strategy parameters: prefer `config/strategies/*.toml` and `StrategyConfig`.
- Every new TOML key: document in `config/strategies/_schema.toml`.
- When editing `strategies/`, migrate legacy `os.getenv(...)` to `cfg.get(...)` (or equivalent on `StrategyConfig`).
- The loader may honor unprefixed env fallbacks (e.g. `STOP_ATR_MULTIPLIER`) for backward compatibility; do not assume prefix-only behavior without reading `core/strategy_config.py`.
